ivy: can someone open a small PR with: OkHttp bump, streaming client config, and the single-inflight refresh util in samples? Keep changes behind a feature flag for canary.

sam: opening PR `devex/sdk-parity-2065432100` with changes and reproducible steps + emulator image links. Will include rationale for Call.Factory vs Interceptor differences in PR description.

diego: if PR reduces flakiness in CI we should add a short section to devex docs: "Android SDK: retry/resend caveats for streaming bodies, recommended OkHttp versions, and parity checklist between Java/Kotlin samples."

